  "note": ["The crypt environment (ps-bop.3.11: a grey stone crypt; neutral grey, the control): the arena's area plan as a necropolis in POLYGON Dungeon's grey stone, with Knights' plinth tombs, gravestones and iron fences and Dark Fantasy's dead trees, tombs, braziers and candles. Pillars, mausoleums, plinth tombs and dead trees for the forest; tombstones, gravestones, broken pillars, balustrade posts, coffins, fences and candle stands for the edge bands; brick rubble, pebbles and worn flagstone slabs on a grey stone ground the forest's value, with no hue. A great hooded statue for the glowing tree, a ring of hooded statues, a mausoleum for the graveyard, balustrades and brick walls for the ruin walls and the courtyard (a paved floor inside), braziers by an altar in the brazier glade, a great ruined gateway at the opening. A white key on the set and the horde, a grey skylight, grey fog and mist, warm candles and braziers the only hue, a neutral grade. Its palette and findings: demo3d/evidence/look/env-crypt/README.md. Format: arena-layout.json's note, Environments."],
